    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You may <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> two opponents at once.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, you may make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Grab\" title=\"Grab\">Grab</a> attack against two targets adjacent to you (roll a separate attack against each target). You must have two empty hands to use this Feat.</p>",
